{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear space, inserts only occasional brief random-walk variation, uses directed one-shot turns for side/front obstacles, allows a rare one-shot backward escape only after front blockage, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort stuck state after repeated blocked outcomes.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability so the supervisor can enforce safe action choices from sensor outcomes.",
    "Layer compact specifications: clear-space progress bias, obstacle-specific recovery, one-shot action commits, and a last-resort full-rotate path only after repeated front blockage."
  ],
